<item>
<title>Telegram macOS</title>
<description>Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Profile gift tiles use liquid glass, like on iOS&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• The profile background no longer changes when the tabs pin while scrolling&lt;br&gt;• Reaction counts are legible in dark appearance&lt;br&gt;• Anonymous admins can delete posts made as the group&lt;br&gt;• Sold on-chain gift lots show from the seller's side&lt;br&gt;• Posts made as the group stay out of member moderation&lt;br&gt;</description>
